---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import GoldenList from '../../components/GoldenList.astro';
import GlassCard from '../../components/GlassCard.astro';
---

<ServiceLayout
  title="The Authority Engine"
  subtitle="Dominate Your Market Narrative. Be Everywhere, Without Doing Everything."
  metaDescription="Turn 30 minutes of talking into 50+ pieces of content. We build a content supply chain that establishes you as the undisputed category king."
>

  <h2>The "Commodity" Trap</h2>
  <p>
    If your prospect does not know who you are before they get on the sales call, you are a commodity. You are competing on price. You are fighting for trust.
  </p>
  <p>
    The market leader does not sell. They "prescribe". When a patient sees a specialist surgeon, they do not ask for a discount. They ask: <em>"When can you fit me in?"</em>
  </p>
  <p>
    To become the Specialist, you must control the narrative. You must act like a Media Company, not a sales organization.
  </p>

  <hr class="border-white/10 my-12" />

  <h2>System Architecture: The "Waterfall" Method</h2>
  <p>
    Most CEOs don't have time to write LinkedIn posts or edit TikToks. And they shouldn't. Your job is to have *thoughts*. Our job is to distribute them.
  </p>
  <p>
    We install the <strong>Content Waterfall Protocol</strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12 not-prose">
    <div class="p-6 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-sm">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 font-mono">The Input (Low Effort)</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <strong>One 30-Minute Interview per week.</strong><br/><br/>
        We get on a Zoom call with you. We ask you strategic questions about your industry, your enemies, and your philosophy. You just talk. That is the only work you do.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-6 bg-gold-900/10 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 font-mono">The Output (Max Scale)</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-100 text-sm font-medium">
        <li class="flex gap-2 text-gold-400">⚡ 1x Long-Form YouTube Video</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2 text-gold-400">⚡ 1x SEO Blog Article (2000 words)</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2 text-gold-400">⚡ 5x LinkedIn Text Posts</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2 text-gold-400">⚡ 3x Twitter Threads</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2 text-gold-400">⚡ 3x Short-Form Reels (TikTok/Shorts)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>The "Pillar Content" Strategy</h2>
  <p>
    We do not post fluff. We engineer content to shift beliefs.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>The "Enemy" Post:</strong> We identify a common enemy in your industry (e.g., "Legacy Agencies") and throw rocks at them. This rallies your tribe.</li>
    <li><strong>The "Old Way vs New Way" Post:</strong> We position your mechanism as the inevitable future.</li>
    <li><strong>The "Social Proof" Post:</strong> We break down a client win in granular detail, proving competence.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Distribution & Amplification</h2>
  <p>
    Posting is not enough. You must Amplify.
  </p>
  <p>
    We use <strong>Paid Distribution</strong> to ensure your content is seen by your exact ICP. We boost your best LinkedIn posts to CEO job titles. We run your YouTube videos as skippable ads to your retargeting list.
  </p>
  <p>
    This creates an ecosystem where your prospect sees you *everywhere*. You become famous to the 5,000 people who matter most to your bank account.
  </p>

  <hr class="border-white/10 my-12" />

  <h2>Technical Specifications</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 not-prose">
    <GlassCard title="SEO Domination">
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-400">
        Every video is transcribed and turned into a keyword-rich article on your site. This compounds over time. In 12 months, you will dominate the search results for every question your industry asks.
      </p>
    </GlassCard>
    <GlassCard title="Newsletter Engine">
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-400">
        We automatically curate your week's content into a high-value email newsletter. This nurtures your list and drives traffic back to your assets.
      </p>
    </GlassCard>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 p-8 border border-gold-500/30 bg-gold-900/5 rounded-lg text-center">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Become The Category King</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8">
      Start your media machine today.
    </p>
    <a href="/#audit" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-black font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-sm transition-colors">
      Launch Authority Engine
    </a>
  </div>

</ServiceLayout>
